                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Secretary General of the League of Nations</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Avenol</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-08-12">August 12,
                        1935</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Secretary of State of the United States of America has received, with
                    appreciation, the note of the Secretary General of the League of Nations, dated
                    July 19, 1935, asking the Government of the United States for information
                    regarding the possibility of settling refugees in the territory of the United
                    States, and has the honor to transmit, in reply, a memorandum for submission to
                    the Nansen International Office.</p>
            </div>
